# Deliberately NOT ignored, so a clone is runnable as-is:
#   .env, packages/*/.env  — Supabase credentials and the local API origin
#   .data/                 — generated media derivatives the feed serves
# This only holds while the repository stays private: packages/server/.env and
# packages/server/src/config/supabase.ts both carry the Supabase service-role
# key, which bypasses row-level security. Rotate it before making the
# repository public or adding collaborators.
